---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact MathGraph — Audits and public project channels" description="Join the MathGraph Open Challenge for a selected free first finding, or use GitHub for public technical reports." currentPath="/contact/">
  <header class="section section--compact"><div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
    <h1>Have a consequential claim? Are you game?</h1>
    <p class="lede">For selected projects, MathGraph offers a bounded free-first-finding investigation with no guaranteed defect. Start privately through our challenge page. Public GitHub issues are for non-confidential reproducible technical reports only.</p>
  </div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell grid">
    <article class="span-6 callout"><h2>Free first-finding challenge</h2><p><a href="/assurance/">Show us your repo — the MathGraph Open Challenge</a></p><p>One consequential claim, source-pinned evidence, and a selected bounded investigation. No code upload is provided on this page.</p></article>
    <article class="span-6 callout"><h2>Repository</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph">github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph ↗</a></p><p>Inspect code, protocols, qualification tests, and immutable evidence sources.</p></article>
    <article class="span-6 callout"><h2>Issues</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph/issues">github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph/issues ↗</a></p><p>Report a reproducible defect or propose a scoped improvement. Public issue handling does not create a trust relationship or verification result.</p></article>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
